"Using  this Codex": {
  "index": 0,
  "category": "basics",
  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "title",
      "value": "Using This Codex"
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "location": "mna:textures/guide/pagination.png",
      "width": 128,
      "height": 34
    },
    {
      "type": "title",
      "value": "Pages"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "json": [
        {
          "text": "When looking at an entry, the "
        },
        {
          "text": "pagination buttons",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": " are shown at the bottom of pages (if there is a previous or next page to turn to)."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "json": [
        {
          "text": "This codex is your guide on how to do the things within the mod. It contains every recipe, mechanic, part, and how to make them.\n\nIt's intended to pair with the "
        },
        {
          "text": "Occulus",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": ", which is a block that shows you what you've unlocked at a given tier as well as tells you what you need to do in order to advance. Use that as a guide to 'what' you have unlocked, and this book as 'how'.\n\nThe "
        },
        {
          "text": "Codex ",
          "color": "black"
        },
        {
          "text": "will only display things that you have unlocked at your current tier."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "location": "mna:textures/guide/back_button.png",
      "width": 30,
      "height": 48,
      "newPage": true
    },
    {
      "type": "title",
      "value": "Return to Category Index"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "json": [
        {
          "text": "When viewing an entry, click the "
        },
        {
          "text": "back button",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": " to return to the category index pages."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "location": "mna:textures/guide/category_buttons.png",
      "width": 28,
      "height": 18,
      "newPage": true
    },
    {
      "type": "title",
      "value": "Categories"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "json": [
        {
          "text": "This codex is broken down into "
        },
        {
          "text": "categories",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": ". They are displayed with green tabs on the side, and represent various logical areas within the mod. Click a category to view the items within it."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "location": "mna:textures/guide/search.png",
      "width": 18,
      "height": 28,
      "newPage": true
    },
    {
      "type": "title",
      "value": "Search"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "json": [
        {
          "text": "Click the "
        },
        {
          "text": "search tab",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": " at the bottom of this UI to bring up a search window. Search for what you're looking for and click the result you want in order to jump to it."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "location": "mna:textures/guide/back_behaviour.png",
      "width": 18,
      "height": 28,
      "newPage": true
    },
    {
      "type": "title",
      "value": "Back Behaviour"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "json": [
        {
          "text": "Click the "
        },
        {
          "text": "back behaviour",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": " tab at the bottom of this UI to change how you navigate through this codex. There is support for changing back to a combination of escape, right mouse, and the UI buttons."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "location": "mna:textures/guide/recipe_buttons.png",
      "width": 28,
      "height": 18,
      "newPage": true
    },
    {
      "type": "title",
      "value": "Recipes"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "json": [
        {
          "text": "When viewing a codex entry, you will often see recipes pinned to the right of the page in blue tabs. Click these to see how to make the given item."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "location": "mna:textures/guide/pin_recipe.png",
      "width": 18,
      "height": 33,
      "newPage": true
    },
    {
      "type": "title",
      "value": "Pinning Recipes"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "json": [
        {
          "text": "When viewing a recipe, in the top left you will see a pin icon. Click this to "
        },
        {
          "text": "pin a recipe to the HUD",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": ". This recipe will show even when the codex is closed. Click any pin on a recipe again to hide it, or click the red pin button that appears in your inventory next to your player representation when you have a recipe pinned."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
